	(text "powered with 8-12v battery\nstep down to 3.3v\ncould use LDO or linear regulator - dissipate power through heat (inefficient)\nswitching regulator - 95% efficient\n\nintake 15-20v\noutputs 3.3v\nprovides 3 amps of current\navialble on lcsc"
