		(uuid "3d1df5bf-cf56-46a0-8a6d-4f5db2cacb7f")
	)
	(text "Implement all power regulation circuitry and connectors. This will likely all be moved to a second board but we will keep it here for now.\nThings include battery connector(xt30) for 2S lipo, main step down regulator (Switching, likely stepping ~7.4v from the battery to 3.3v),\nand other relevant circuitry.\n\nIt may be difficult to finish this until everything else is specced, but a start would be implementing a 3.3v buck regulator that can\nhandle ~5 Amps."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.526 30.734 0)
		(effects
